\section{Conclusion}\label{sec:conclusions}
% In this paper, we introduced ZeroED, a novel zero-shot approach for tabular data error detection that leverages LLMs for adaptable feature engineering, without predefined constraints and manual labels.
% By reasoning data-specific error-judging criteria through a three-step structured reasoning process, multi-perspective representations of data correctness are generated, tailored to each dataset's unique error characteristics.
