Let $f\in L^2(G)$ be nonnegative and $S$ a subset of indexes of the inequivalent irreducible representations of $G$. Then
\begin{equation*}
	\sum_{r\in T(S)} d_r \sum_{i,j=1}^{d_r} |(\widehat f (\pi^r))_{i,j}|^2 \geq \frac{\text{deg(S)}}{|G|} \| f\|^2\,.
