From Theorem~\ref{thm:pent-pdl} and \ref{thm:suc-pent-pdl-upper-lower},  we can deduce similar ones for the team logic without dependence atoms $\TPL$. 
Note, that the model checking problem for $\TPL$ is (potentially) easier than for $\PDL$, as has been shown in $\Ptime$~\cite[Tab.~1]{DBLP:conf/sofsem/EbbingL12}. 
