This publication is part of the project `Social robotics and generative AI to support and enhance creative experiences for older adults', financed by Doctoral Grant for Teachers project number 023.019.021 from the Dutch Research Council (NWO). The course `Drawing with Robots' was funded by Lang Leve Kunst Fonds in The Netherlands.


