\section{Conclusion}
\label{sec: Conclusion}
The paper introduced a new method that leverages deep reinforcement learning to find a dynamic computation offloading strategy in mobile edge computing. The proposed Twin Delayed DDPG algorithm outperformed the previous DDPG algorithm, particularly when users are portable. In the future, we will consider many other simulation setups and use Multi-agent Reinforcement Learning algorithms to provide better results for this problem.

