\subsection{MU-MIMO Scenario}
For the MU-MIMO system,  We assume the number of RF chains at the BS is ${N_t^{RF}} = 16$ and it connects ${N_t} = 32$ RIMSA elements. The BS serves $M=4$ UEs, and each connected to an RIMSA with ${N_r} = 16$ and has ${N_r^{RF}} = 4$ RF chains.
