\section{Methodology}
Our approach to content-aware layout generation (CAL-RAG) leverages a multi-agent system integrated with a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) framework. The overall system architecture comprises four key components: a Layout Recommender Agent, a Layout Generation Tool, a Grader Agent, and a Feedback Agent (see Figure. \ref{fig:system_achitecture}). This framework facilitates an iterative process of layout creation and refinement, aiming to produce high-quality, content-aware visual-textual presentations.

\subsection{Layout Recommender Agent}
